<style>
  .help-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding-top: 2;
    padding-bottom: 2;
    padding-left: 3;
    padding-right: 3;
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.92);
    border-color: #ff6600;
    border-width: 0.12;
    border-radius: 1.5;
  }
  .help-title {
    font-size: 2.8;
    color: #ff6600;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 1;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .help-section {
    font-size: 1.5;
    color: #ffaa44;
    margin-top: 0.6;
    margin-bottom: 0.3;
  }
  .help-text {
    font-size: 1.1;
    color: #cccccc;
    margin-bottom: 0.15;
  }
  .help-back {
    font-size: 1.5;
    color: #aaaaaa;
    background-color: rgba(100, 100, 100, 0.2);
    border-color: #666666;
    border-width: 0.06;
    border-radius: 0.6;
    padding-top: 0.5;
    padding-bottom: 0.5;
    padding-left: 2;
    padding-right: 2;
    margin-top: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    align-items: center;
  }
</style>
<div class="help-panel">
  <span class="help-title">HOW TO PLAY</span>
  <span class="help-section">VR Controls</span>
  <span class="help-text">Right Trigger: Hold to charge, release to shoot</span>
  <span class="help-text">B Button: Pause game</span>
  <span class="help-text">Laser Pointer: Navigate menus</span>
  <span class="help-section">Browser Controls</span>
  <span class="help-text">Click + Drag Up: Charge power (higher = stronger)</span>
  <span class="help-text">Mouse Left/Right: Aim direction</span>
  <span class="help-text">Release: Shoot the ball</span>
  <span class="help-section">Keyboard Shortcuts</span>
  <span class="help-text">ESC: Pause / Resume</span>
  <span class="help-text">R: Quick restart (game over screen)</span>
  <span class="help-text">M: Return to menu (game over screen)</span>
  <span class="help-text">1-7: Quick mode select from title/modes</span>
  <span class="help-section">Game Modes (7)</span>
  <span class="help-text">Free Throw: 10 shots from the line</span>
  <span class="help-text">Three-Point Contest: 5 racks, 60s timer</span>
  <span class="help-text">Arcade: Progressive difficulty, 30s timer</span>
  <span class="help-text">H.O.R.S.E.: Match shots vs AI opponent</span>
  <span class="help-text">Trick Shots: 10 special shot challenges</span>
  <span class="help-text">Daily Challenge: 10 daily shots, same for all</span>
  <span class="help-text">Practice: Unlimited, no pressure</span>
  <span class="help-section">Scoring</span>
  <span class="help-text">Swish (no rim): 3 pts</span>
  <span class="help-text">Clean make: 2 pts</span>
  <span class="help-text">Three-point range: +1 bonus</span>
  <span class="help-text">Half-court range: +2 bonus</span>
  <span class="help-text">Streak 3+: escalating bonus per make</span>
  <span id="btn-help-back" class="help-back" cursor="pointer">BACK</span>
</div>
